rison of the MetricVBT App and the Vitruve Linear Position Transducer for Assessing Execution Velocity and ROM."}, {"doi": "10.1186/s40798-026-01102-0", "pmid": "42690493", "pmcid": "PMC13542044", "title": "Reliability, Device Agreement and Validity of Load-Velocity Profiles: A Systematic Review with Meta-analysis."}, {"doi": "10.3390/healthcare13080905", "pmid": "40281854", "pmcid": "PMC12026825", "title": "Evaluating the Agreement and Associations with Physical Function Between Equation- and Linear Position Transducer-Estimated Sit-to-Stand Muscle Power in Aging Adults."}, {"doi": "10.3390/s26206466", "pmid": "42944328", "pmcid": "PMC13709254", "title": "Comparing Repetition-Velocity Output from a Motor-Integrated Magnetic Sensing System with That of a Linear Position Transducer Across Resistance Exercises and Loads: A Human Trial Experiment."}], "records": 44, "unique_works": 38, "provider_failures": 0, "identity_conflicts": 0}, "created_at": "2026-11-17T14:39:03.275033+00:00"}

